# Village reverse pages (phase 2). (EN name, genitive after iz/do, EN time)
R = [("Grebaštica", "Grebaštice", "45 min"), ("Marušići", "Marušića", "55 min"), ("Pisak", "Piska", "50 min"),
     ("Primošten", "Primoštena", None), ("Promajna", "Promajne", "1 h"), ("Ražanj", "Ražnja", "40 min"),
     ("Seget Donji", "Segeta Donjeg", "12 min"), ("Tučepi", "Tučepa", "1 h 15 min"), ("Vinišće", "Vinišća", "25 min"),
     ("Živogošće", "Živogošća", "1 h 30 min"), ("Marina Frapa Rogoznica", "Marine Frapa u Rogoznici", "35 min")]
T = {}
for en, gen, tm in R:
    T[f"{en} to Split Airport Transfer | Airport Split Transfer"] = f"Transfer iz {gen} do Zračne luke Split | Airport Split Transfer"
    if tm:
        T[f"Private transfer from {en} to Split Airport: {tm} drive. Enter your addresses for an instant fixed price. Book online in minutes."] = f"Privatni transfer iz {gen} do Zračne luke Split: vožnja {tm}. Upišite adrese i odmah dobivate fiksnu cijenu. Online rezervacija za par minuta."
    T[f"{en} → Split Airport"] = f"{en} → Zračna luka Split"
    T[f"Split Airport to {en} transfer"] = f"transfer od Zračne luke Split do {gen}"
T.update({
"What's the fixed price for a transfer from Grebaštica to the airport?": "Kolika je fiksna cijena transfera iz Grebaštice do aerodroma?",
"What happens if I'm not ready when the driver arrives for pickup?": "Što ako nisam spreman kad vozač stigne?",
"Drivers typically wait a short grace period at no extra charge: if you think you'll need longer, just let us know in advance or message us on WhatsApp and we'll do our best to adjust.": "Vozači obično besplatno pričekaju kraće vrijeme; ako mislite da će vam trebati dulje, javite nam unaprijed ili pišite na WhatsApp i potrudit ćemo se prilagoditi.",
"Leaving Grebaštica, the road climbs away from the bay for the first couple of kilometres, narrow and unhurried, before joining the main coast route and picking up pace for the rest of the run to the motorway. The surrounding countryside is classic Šibenik hinterland, low hills of scrub and vineyard, the odd stone farmhouse, for most of the drive north, with barely a hint of the coast again until the airport approach itself. At 47 kilometres and roughly 45 minutes, it's a mid-length run that sits between the short Trogir-area transfers and the longer haul back from Vodice or Zadar, an easy single leg without a break. The motorway link that speeds up most of this drive was a relatively recent addition to this part of Croatia's road network, and it makes the return run from a village like Grebaštica considerably quicker than it would have been even a decade or two ago.": "Iz Grebaštice se cesta prvih par kilometara penje od uvale, uska i mirna, a zatim se spaja s glavnom obalnom cestom i ubrzava do autoceste. Veći dio vožnje okolica je tipično šibensko zaleđe, niska brda s makijom i vinogradima i pokoja kamena kuća, a mora gotovo nema na vidiku sve do prilaza aerodromu. S 47 kilometara i otprilike 45 minuta, to je vožnja srednje duljine, između kratkih transfera oko Trogira i duljih iz Vodica ili Zadra, lako se vozi u komadu. Dionica autoceste koja ubrzava većinu puta relativno je nova na ovom dijelu hrvatske cestovne mreže, pa je povratak iz mjesta poput Grebaštice znatno brži nego prije desetak ili dvadesetak godina.",
"Tell us your flight time when you book and we'll schedule your pickup in Grebaštica to get you to Split Airport with a comfortable margin, no need to guess or build in extra waiting yourself. There's no shuttle routing and no other passengers to collect first: it's a direct run to the terminal, luggage loaded once at your accommodation and unloaded once at the airport. Given how compact the village is, drivers rarely need detailed directions once they know which stretch of the bay you're staying on, but it's still worth including your accommodation name in the booking notes so the pickup is exact rather than approximate, useful on a first visit when house numbers along the seafront aren't always clearly marked from the road. Families travelling with young children or beach equipment will find the Business Van a comfortable choice for the extra space, though the standard Sedan handles the trip just as easily for smaller groups with regular luggage.": "Pri rezervaciji nam napišite vrijeme leta i preuzimanje u Grebaštici dogovorit ćemo tako da na Zračnu luku Split stignete s dovoljno vremena, bez nagađanja i dodatnog čekanja. Nema rute shuttlea ni drugih putnika koje treba prvo pokupiti: vozite izravno do terminala, prtljaga se utovaruje jednom kod smještaja i istovaruje jednom na aerodromu. Mjesto je malo pa vozačima rijetko trebaju detaljne upute kad znaju na kojem dijelu uvale odsjedate, ali ipak upišite ime smještaja u napomenu da preuzimanje bude točno, što pomaže pri prvom dolasku kad kućni brojevi uz more nisu uvijek dobro vidljivi s ceste. Obiteljima s malom djecom ili opremom za plažu poslovni kombi bit će udobniji zbog dodatnog prostora, a limuzina jednako lako odradi vožnju za manje grupe s običnom prtljagom.",
"What's the fixed price from Marušići to the airport?": "Kolika je fiksna cijena iz Marušića do aerodroma?",
"Leaving Marušići, the road heads north back along the same coast route used for Pisak, staying close to the water the whole way with Biokovo's grey cliffs a constant backdrop on the inland side. At 55 kilometres and about 55 minutes, it's a straightforward run back up the Omiš–Makarska stretch, long enough to watch the coastline change from the open beaches south of Marušići to Omiš's river mouth as the airport approaches. The road itself is well maintained along this section, with regular passing points and clear sightlines despite the tight curves the cliffside route demands, and the mountain wall stays close on one side almost the whole way until the final approach to the airport. Locals sometimes call this whole stretch of coast road the most beautiful hour of driving in Dalmatia, and it's hard to disagree in either direction once the light catches the cliffs and water at the same time.": "Iz Marušića cesta vodi na sjever istom obalnom rutom kao kroz Pisak, cijelim putem uz more, a sive litice Biokova stalno su u pozadini s kopnene strane. S 55 kilometara i oko 55 minuta, to je jednostavna vožnja natrag dionicom Makarska–Omiš, dovoljno duga da vidite kako se obala mijenja od otvorenih plaža južno od Marušića do ušća Cetine u Omišu. Cesta je na ovom dijelu dobro održavana, s mjestima za mimoilaženje i dobrom preglednošću unatoč oštrim zavojima uz litice, a planinski zid gotovo cijelim putem ostaje blizu s jedne strane. Mještani ovu dionicu ponekad zovu najljepšim satom vožnje u Dalmaciji, i teško je ne složiti se, u bilo kojem smjeru, kad svjetlo istodobno obasja litice i more.",
"Tell us your flight time when you book and we'll schedule your pickup to get you to Split Airport with a comfortable margin, no guesswork needed on your side. It's a direct, private drive the whole way, with luggage handled at both ends and no shared stops along the route. As with the neighbouring villages on this stretch, Marušići has no real central address system, so noting your accommodation's name and roughly which cove it sits above helps the driver find the right turning off the coast road without doubling back to check house numbers that often aren't visible from the road. Given the quiet, scattered nature of the village, some guests arrange for the driver to call ahead a few minutes before pickup so someone can be waiting at the roadside rather than the driver searching for a property that isn't visible from the main road, worth adding to your booking notes if your accommodation is set back from the coast road itself.": "Pri rezervaciji nam napišite vrijeme leta i preuzimanje ćemo dogovoriti tako da na Zračnu luku Split stignete s dovoljno vremena, bez nagađanja s vaše strane. Vožnja je izravna i privatna cijelim putem, s pomoći s prtljagom na oba kraja i bez zajedničkih stajanja. Kao i susjedna mjesta na ovom potezu, Marušići nemaju pravi sustav adresa, pa ime smještaja i otprilike iznad koje je uvale pomažu vozaču da nađe pravo skretanje s obalne ceste bez vraćanja zbog kućnih brojeva koji se s ceste često ne vide. Budući da je mjesto mirno i raštrkano, neki gosti zamole vozača da nazove nekoliko minuta prije preuzimanja kako bi ih netko čekao uz cestu, umjesto da vozač traži kuću koja se s glavne ceste ne vidi, pa to upišite u napomenu ako je vaš smještaj podalje od obalne ceste.",
"How much does a transfer from Pisak to Split Airport cost?": "Koliko košta transfer iz Piska do Zračne luke Split?",
"Can we stop in Omiš on the way to the airport?": "Možemo li na putu do aerodroma stati u Omišu?",
"The drive from Pisak follows the coast road north past Omiš, the route narrowing and climbing along the base of the cliffs that define this whole stretch of the Makarska Riviera before opening out toward the airport. It's one of the more scenic legs on this list in either direction: the road threads between rock face and sea for long sections, with the water rarely out of view. The same pull-offs that mark the best viewpoints on the way down work just as well heading back, where the road briefly widens above a sheer drop to the water. At 52 kilometres and around 50 minutes, it's long enough to properly settle in and enjoy the drive rather than just endure it, particularly in good morning light on an early return flight. This stretch of coast road was cut into the cliffside decades ago and remains one of the more dramatic pieces of civil engineering on the Croatian Adriatic, worth appreciating from the passenger seat in either direction.": "Vožnja iz Piska ide obalnom cestom na sjever pokraj Omiša, cesta se sužava i penje uz podnožje litica koje obilježavaju cijeli ovaj dio Makarske rivijere, a zatim se otvara prema aerodromu. U oba smjera ovo je jedna od slikovitijih dionica s popisa: cesta dugo vijuga između stijene i mora, a more je gotovo stalno na vidiku. Ista proširenja koja na putu dolje označavaju najbolje vidikovce jednako vrijede i na povratku, gdje se cesta nakratko širi iznad okomitog pada u more. S 52 kilometra i oko 50 minuta, vožnja je dovoljno duga da se opustite i uživate, osobito po lijepom jutarnjem svjetlu na ranom povratnom letu. Ova dionica obalne ceste usječena je u litice prije nekoliko desetljeća i i danas je jedan od dojmljivijih građevinskih pothvata na hrvatskom Jadranu, koji vrijedi doživjeti sa suvozačkog mjesta u bilo kojem smjeru.",
"Tell us your flight time when you book and we'll schedule your pickup to reach Split Airport with a comfortable margin. The drive up is direct and private, with a stop possible en route if you'd like to see the Omiš gorge, mention this when booking and the driver can factor in the extra time. Because Pisak is so small, exact addresses can be vague; giving the name of your accommodation or the nearest named restaurant along the coast road helps the driver find the right stretch quickly rather than doubling back along a road with limited passing space. Given the scenic nature of this drive, some guests choose a slightly earlier pickup specifically to enjoy the coast road in good morning light, a preference worth mentioning at booking if it applies to you.": "Pri rezervaciji nam napišite vrijeme leta i preuzimanje ćemo dogovoriti tako da na Zračnu luku Split stignete s dovoljno vremena. Vožnja je izravna i privatna, a usput se možete zaustaviti ako želite vidjeti kanjon Cetine kod Omiša: navedite to pri rezervaciji i vozač će uračunati dodatno vrijeme. Pisak je toliko malen da adrese znaju biti nejasne; ime smještaja ili najbližeg restorana uz obalnu cestu pomaže vozaču da brzo nađe pravi dio, umjesto da se vraća cestom na kojoj je teško mimoilaženje. Zbog ljepote ove vožnje neki gosti namjerno biraju malo ranije preuzimanje da obalnu cestu vide po lijepom jutarnjem svjetlu, pa to navedite pri rezervaciji ako vam je važno.",
"Primošten to Split Airport Transfer | Airport Split Transfer": "Transfer iz Primoštena do Zračne luke Split | Airport Split Transfer",
"Book a private transfer from Primošten's peninsula old town to Split Airport. Fixed price, English-speaking driver, reliable pickup timed to your flight.": "Rezervirajte privatni transfer iz stare jezgre Primoštena do Zračne luke Split. Fiksna cijena i pouzdano preuzimanje prema vremenu leta.",
"How much does a transfer from Primošten to Split Airport cost?": "Koliko košta transfer iz Primoštena do Zračne luke Split?",
"Can the driver pick me up directly from a hotel or campsite outside the old town?": "Može li me vozač preuzeti izravno u hotelu ili kampu izvan stare jezgre?",
"Yes, most of Primošten's accommodation is spread along the coast on either side of the peninsula rather than inside the car-free old town itself, so give us the exact property name when you book and your driver will collect you directly from there.": "Da, većina smještaja u Primoštenu raspoređena je uz obalu s obje strane poluotoka, a ne u samoj staroj jezgri u koju automobili ne ulaze, pa nam pri rezervaciji pošaljite točno ime objekta i vozač će vas preuzeti ondje.",
"Is the old town walkable, or is it far from where I'd be picked up?": "Može li se stara jezgra obići pješice, ili je daleko od mjesta preuzimanja?",
"Primošten's old town sits on a peninsula reached by a single causeway closed to general traffic, so a transfer collects you from the car park just before it: getting there from the church at the top or anywhere in between is a short, if occasionally steep, walk.": "Stara jezgra Primoštena nalazi se na poluotoku do kojeg vodi jedan nasip zatvoren za promet, pa vas transfer preuzima na parkiralištu odmah ispred: do njega je od crkve na vrhu ili bilo kojeg mjesta između kratka, iako mjestimice strma šetnja.",
"Can I combine a transfer from Primošten with a stop in Rogoznica or Trogir?": "Mogu li transfer iz Primoštena spojiti sa stajanjem u Rogoznici ili Trogiru?",
"Primošten's old town spills down a narrow peninsula into the Adriatic, ringed by centuries-old vineyards: a private transfer gets you back to Split Airport directly, with no changes or waiting in between.": "Stara jezgra Primoštena spušta se niz uski poluotok u Jadran, okružena stoljetnim vinogradima: privatni transfer vozi vas natrag do Zračne luke Split izravno, bez presjedanja i čekanja.",
"The drive back from Primošten to Split Airport retraces the same corridor south through Rogoznica and Trogir and along Kaštela Bay before reaching the terminal: typically somewhere around forty-five minutes to an hour outside the busiest summer traffic, depending on which of the two road options your driver takes on the day. Because the route runs the same corridor as several other well-known stops on this coast, it's an easy one to combine with a stop elsewhere on the way, and the timing works the same as the outbound trip, provided the usual allowance for summer weekend traffic through Kaštela Bay.": "Vožnja iz Primoštena do Zračne luke Split vraća se istim pravcem na jug pokraj Rogoznice i Trogira do terminala: izvan najveće ljetne gužve obično između četrdeset pet minuta i sat vremena, ovisno o tome koju od dvije ceste vozač odabere taj dan. Budući da ruta prolazi istim pravcem kao nekoliko drugih poznatih mjesta na obali, lako ju je spojiti sa stajanjem usput, a trajanje je isto kao u dolasku, uz uobičajenu rezervu za ljetni vikend promet kroz Kaštelanski zaljev.",
"Tell us your flight time when you book, and we'll schedule your pickup from Primošten with enough margin to reach Split Airport comfortably, particularly useful since the town sits a little further from the airport than some of the coast's closer stops. Because the causeway into the old town is closed to general traffic and the streets themselves are on foot only, give your driver the exact pickup point when you book: the car park just before the causeway, a specific resort reception, or a harbour-side meeting point. If you're staying at one of the resorts or campsites along the coast either side of the peninsula rather than in the old town itself, give your driver the property name directly, since the area covers a longer stretch of coastline than the old town alone. Build in slightly more margin than you would from one of the airport's very closest destinations, particularly on a summer Saturday, when resort changeover traffic adds to the ordinary load on the coastal road.": "Pri rezervaciji nam napišite vrijeme leta i preuzimanje u Primoštenu dogovorit ćemo s dovoljno rezerve da mirno stignete na Zračnu luku Split, što je korisno jer je mjesto malo dalje od aerodroma nego neka bliža odredišta. Budući da je nasip prema staroj jezgri zatvoren za promet, a ulice su samo pješačke, pri rezervaciji vozaču navedite točno mjesto preuzimanja: parkiralište ispred nasipa, recepciju određenog resorta ili mjesto susreta uz luku. Ako odsjedate u nekom od resorta ili kampova uz obalu s obje strane poluotoka, a ne u samoj jezgri, vozaču dajte ime objekta, jer se područje proteže duljim dijelom obale od same jezgre. Računajte s malo više rezerve nego iz najbližih mjesta, osobito ljeti subotom, kad smjena gostiju u resortima dodatno opterećuje obalnu cestu.",
"What is the fixed price for a transfer from Promajna to the airport?": "Kolika je fiksna cijena transfera iz Promajne do aerodroma?",
"Leaving Promajna, the drive retraces the full stretch of coast road north back through the smaller villages and Omiš before reaching Split Airport, a little over an hour covering 63 kilometres. The road narrows gradually as it leaves Promajna's longer beach frontage behind, a reflection of the resort's larger scale compared with the smaller villages the route passes through further north. Traffic can build noticeably on Saturday changeover days in peak season, when accommodation across the whole riviera turns over at once, though this affects the drive out of Promajna itself far more than the open road further along. Outside those peak changeover windows, this remains one of the more relaxed drives on the whole itinerary, with wide sea views for much of the first half of the journey.": "Iz Promajne se vozi cijelom obalnom cestom na sjever kroz manja mjesta i Omiš do Zračne luke Split, nešto više od sat vremena za 63 kilometra. Cesta se postupno sužava kako ostavlja dugu plažu Promajne iza sebe, jer je mjesto veće od onih kroz koja ruta prolazi sjevernije. U sezoni subotom, kad se smještaj na cijeloj rivijeri mijenja odjednom, promet se zna zgusnuti, ali to više utječe na izlazak iz same Promajne nego na otvorenu cestu dalje. Izvan tih subotnjih gužvi ovo je jedna od opuštenijih vožnji na cijelom popisu, sa širokim pogledima na more veći dio prve polovice puta.",
"Tell us your flight time when you book and we'll schedule your pickup in Promajna to reach Split Airport with a comfortable margin, even if your flight is a few hours out. It's a direct run up the coast road, luggage loaded once and unloaded at the terminal, with no shared shuttle stops along the way. Promajna's larger size compared with the smaller villages nearby means street numbering is more straightforward, but with several hotels and apartment blocks sharing similar names along the promenade, it's still worth confirming your exact property when booking so the driver finds you without any confusion. Groups travelling together for a family holiday will find the Business Van a practical option, with enough room for luggage, beach gear and car seats where needed, all for one fixed price regardless of how many passengers are travelling on the day.": "Pri rezervaciji nam napišite vrijeme leta i preuzimanje u Promajni dogovorit ćemo tako da na Zračnu luku Split stignete s dovoljno vremena, čak i ako vam je let tek za nekoliko sati. Vozite izravno obalnom cestom, prtljaga se utovaruje jednom i istovaruje na terminalu, bez stajanja zajedničkog prijevoza. Promajna je veća od okolnih mjesta pa su kućni brojevi jasniji, ali budući da nekoliko hotela i apartmanskih zgrada uz šetnicu ima slična imena, pri rezervaciji ipak potvrdite točan objekt kako bi vas vozač našao bez zabune. Grupama koje putuju zajedno na obiteljski odmor poslovni kombi praktičan je izbor, s dovoljno mjesta za prtljagu, opremu za plažu i autosjedalice, sve po jednoj fiksnoj cijeni bez obzira na broj putnika.",
"What does a private transfer from Ražanj to the airport cost?": "Koliko košta privatni transfer iz Ražnja do aerodroma?",
"Leaving Ražanj means first climbing back up the narrow spur off the peninsula and through the olive groves and dry-stone walls typical of this part of the Šibenik hinterland, before rejoining the main coastal road toward the airport, a route a local driver navigates without the last-minute doubling back that a self-driven rental sometimes involves. At 39 kilometres and about 40 minutes to the terminal, it sits comfortably within a single, unhurried airport run, with the first stretch slow enough to properly leave the quiet coastal lane behind before the road opens onto the highway. Outside the height of summer this is one of the quieter roads on the whole itinerary, with long stretches where you'll see more olive terraces than oncoming traffic.": "Iz Ražnja se najprije penje natrag uskom cestom s poluotoka, kroz maslinike i suhozide tipične za šibensko zaleđe, do glavne obalne ceste prema aerodromu, ruta koju lokalni vozač vozi bez vraćanja u zadnji čas koje se ponekad događa s unajmljenim autom. S 39 kilometara i oko 40 minuta do terminala, to je jedna mirna vožnja do aerodroma, a prva dionica dovoljno je spora da se oprostite od tihe obalne ceste prije nego što izađete na brzu cestu. Izvan vrhunca ljeta ovo je jedna od najmirnijih cesta na cijelom popisu, s dugim dionicama na kojima ćete vidjeti više maslinika nego vozila iz suprotnog smjera.",
"Tell us your flight time when you book and we'll schedule your pickup in Ražanj to get you to Split Airport with a comfortable margin. It's a direct, private drive the whole way: no shuttle bus, no stops to collect other passengers. If you're travelling with dive gear, mention it in the booking notes; the boot space in both the Sedan and the vans comfortably takes a full set of dive bags alongside regular luggage. Given the narrower approach road onto the peninsula itself, it's worth confirming your exact accommodation or harbour side when booking, since Ražanj effectively has two separate waterfronts and the wrong one can mean a longer walk with bags before pickup than necessary. Drivers covering this route regularly know both sides well and will ask if it isn't already clear from your booking notes.": "Pri rezervaciji nam napišite vrijeme leta i preuzimanje u Ražnju dogovorit ćemo tako da na Zračnu luku Split stignete s dovoljno vremena. Vožnja je izravna i privatna cijelim putem: bez shuttle autobusa i bez stajanja zbog drugih putnika. Ako putujete s ronilačkom opremom, navedite to u napomeni; i limuzina i kombiji imaju dovoljno mjesta za cijeli komplet ronilačkih torbi uz običnu prtljagu. Zbog užeg prilaza samom poluotoku pri rezervaciji potvrdite točan smještaj ili stranu luke, jer Ražanj zapravo ima dvije zasebne obale, a pogrešna može značiti dulje hodanje s torbama do preuzimanja. Vozači koji redovito voze ovu rutu dobro poznaju obje strane i pitat će vas ako to nije jasno iz napomene.",
"Marina Frapa Rogoznica to Split Airport | Airport Split Transfer": "Transfer iz Marine Frapa u Rogoznici do Zračne luke Split | Airport Split Transfer",
"How much does a transfer from Marina Frapa to Split Airport cost?": "Koliko košta transfer iz Marine Frapa do Zračne luke Split?",
"Can the driver collect me straight from my berth or boatyard reception?": "Može li me vozač preuzeti ravno na vezu ili kod recepcije brodogradilišta?",
"Yes, give the exact pontoon or reception building in the notes when you book, and the driver will meet you at the correct marina entrance rather than the main town car park.": "Da, pri rezervaciji u napomenu upišite točan gat ili zgradu recepcije i vozač će vas čekati na pravom ulazu u marinu, a ne na glavnom parkiralištu u mjestu.",
"What if my charter check-out is early but my flight is much later, or the other way round?": "Što ako mi je iskrcaj s chartera rano, a let puno kasnije, ili obrnuto?",
"Let us know both times when you book: we can schedule the pickup for whenever suits you between check-out and your flight, not just straight after one or the other.": "Javite nam oba vremena pri rezervaciji: preuzimanje možemo dogovoriti kad god vam odgovara između iskrcaja i leta, a ne samo odmah nakon jednog ili prije drugog.",
"Marina Frapa Rogoznica": "Marina Frapa Rogoznica",
"Marina Frapa is one of the most decorated marinas in the Mediterranean, tucked into a sheltered bay beside the fishing town of Rogoznica.": "Marina Frapa jedna je od najnagrađivanijih marina na Mediteranu, smještena u zaštićenoj uvali uz ribarsko mjesto Rogoznicu.",
"The drive from Rogoznica leaves Marina Frapa on the same coastal road south, tracing the shoreline back past the low, rocky headlands and Kaštela Bay toward the airport. This stretch of road runs close enough to the water for long sea views on a clear day, with Čiovo and the Trogir channel coming into view ahead for the later part of the drive as the coast turns from open and exposed to more sheltered. At thirty-four kilometres and around thirty-five minutes under normal traffic, it's a manageable last leg of a sailing trip, not long enough to need a stop, but long enough to be glad of a fixed price agreed before you set off. Traffic on this section is generally light outside the tightest July and August weekend changeover windows, when charter turnarounds across the whole coast tend to cluster around Saturday mornings.": "Iz Marine Frapa u Rogoznici vozi se istom obalnom cestom na jug, uz obalu pokraj niskih stjenovitih rtova prema aerodromu. Ova dionica ceste dovoljno je blizu mora da za vedrog dana imate duge poglede na pučinu, a Čiovo i Trogirski kanal pojavljuju se ispred vas u drugom dijelu vožnje, kad otvorena obala postaje zaštićenija. S trideset četiri kilometra i oko trideset pet minuta u normalnom prometu, ovo je lagan zadnji dio jedriličarskog putovanja: nije dovoljno dug da treba pauza, ali je dovoljno dug da vam bude drago što je cijena dogovorena prije polaska. Promet na ovoj dionici uglavnom je slab, osim u najgušćim vikendima smjene u srpnju i kolovozu, kad se izmjene charter posada na cijeloj obali skupljaju oko subotnjeg jutra.",
"About Marina Frapa Rogoznica": "O Marini Frapa u Rogoznici",
"Give us your marina berth and rough departure time when you book, and we'll schedule your pickup to get you to Split Airport with a comfortable margin rather than a rushed dash. Luggage, sailing bags, boat boxes, the odd case of provisions, goes straight into the boot, and the drive south is a single, direct run with no shared stops along the way. If your pickup is timed around a charter company's check-out window, mention it in the notes field and the driver will plan around it rather than a fixed clock time. For groups leaving the same boat together, the Business Van or Van comfortably takes both passengers and gear together rather than splitting the party across two vehicles, and the driver is happy to help load anything awkward, coolers, folded sails, cases of provisions, straight from the pontoon. We also track your flight once you're checked in, so if it shifts, we can adjust on the day.": "Pri rezervaciji nam javite vez u marini i okvirno vrijeme polaska i preuzimanje ćemo dogovoriti tako da na Zračnu luku Split stignete s dovoljno vremena, bez žurbe. Prtljaga, jedriličarske torbe, kutije za brod i pokoja kutija namirnica idu ravno u prtljažnik, a vožnja na jug je jedan izravan potez bez zajedničkih stajanja. Ako je preuzimanje vezano uz vrijeme iskrcaja kod charter tvrtke, navedite to u napomeni i vozač će se prilagoditi tome, a ne fiksnom satu. Za grupe koje zajedno napuštaju isti brod, poslovni kombi ili kombi udobno primaju i putnike i opremu zajedno, umjesto da se društvo dijeli u dva vozila, a vozač rado pomaže utovariti sve nezgrapno, hladnjake, složena jedra i kutije namirnica, ravno s gata. Kad se prijavite na let, pratimo ga, pa ako se vrijeme promijeni, prilagodit ćemo se na dan polaska.",
"What does a 12-minute transfer from Seget Donji cost?": "Koliko košta transfer od 12 minuta iz Segeta Donjeg?",
"Seget Donji is about as close to the airport as any destination on this coast: eight kilometres and around twelve minutes, most of it spent on the short stretch of road that runs along Kaštela Bay before reaching the terminal. It's less a journey than a quick hop, but the fixed price and a driver briefed on your flight time still apply exactly as they would for a longer run. Departing guests get one of the fastest and most scenic routes to the terminal anywhere on this list, with Čiovo island and Trogir's bell tower visible behind for the first couple of minutes before the road opens toward the airport. For visitors on a tight connection, an evening ferry followed by an early flight, for instance, this short transfer time is often the deciding factor in choosing Seget Donji as a last-night base before flying home.": "Seget Donji je blizu aerodroma koliko i bilo koje odredište na ovoj obali: osam kilometara i oko dvanaest minuta, većinom kratkom cestom do terminala. To je više kratak skok nego putovanje, ali fiksna cijena i vozač koji zna vrijeme vašeg leta vrijede jednako kao i za dulju vožnju. Gosti na odlasku imaju jednu od najbržih i najslikovitijih ruta do terminala na cijelom popisu, s Čiovom i trogirskim zvonikom iza sebe u prvih par minuta. Za goste s tijesnim presjedanjem, primjerice večernji trajekt pa rani let, ovo kratko vrijeme vožnje često je presudno da Seget Donji odaberu za zadnju noć prije povratka kući.",
"Given the short distance, your driver won't need much lead time to reach you, but we still ask for your flight time so the pickup accounts for check-in and security comfortably. It's a direct, private run with your luggage handled once at each end, no shared shuttle and no detour to collect other passengers. Because so many Seget Donji properties are large resort complexes rather than individually numbered houses, it's worth naming the specific hotel or apartment complex clearly when booking: reception buildings in this area can sit a reasonable walk from the main road, and a driver who knows the exact entrance saves genuine time compared with a generic pickup at the roadside. This short route is also a common choice for guests connecting from a ferry in Split, where a fixed, reliable pickup time matters more than the length of the drive itself, and the driver can build in extra margin on request if your connection from the ferry is tight.": "Zbog kratke udaljenosti vozaču ne treba puno vremena da stigne do vas, ali svejedno tražimo vrijeme leta kako bi preuzimanje ostavilo dovoljno vremena za prijavu na let i sigurnosnu kontrolu. Vožnja je izravna i privatna, s prtljagom na oba kraja, bez zajedničkog prijevoza i bez obilaska zbog drugih putnika. Budući da su mnogi objekti u Segetu Donjem veliki resorti, a ne pojedinačne kuće s brojem, pri rezervaciji jasno navedite hotel ili apartmansko naselje: recepcije su ponekad podalje od glavne ceste, a vozač koji zna točan ulaz štedi vrijeme u usporedbi s preuzimanjem uz cestu. Ovu kratku rutu često biraju i gosti koji dolaze s trajekta u Splitu, kad je pouzdano vrijeme preuzimanja važnije od duljine vožnje, a vozač na zahtjev može ostaviti dodatnu rezervu ako je presjedanje s trajekta tijesno.",
"What does a transfer from Tučepi to Split Airport cost?": "Koliko košta transfer iz Tučepa do Zračne luke Split?",
"Is it possible to stop at the Omiš zipline on the way to the airport?": "Možemo li na putu do aerodroma stati na zip-lineu u Omišu?",
"Leaving Tučepi is a longer leg, 82 kilometres and around 75 minutes, retracing the full run of the Makarska Riviera coast road north past Promajna, Marušići, Pisak and Omiš before reaching Split Airport. It's a proper journey rather than a quick hop, and one of the more rewarding drives on this list simply for the amount of coastline it covers along the way. As the road leaves Tučepi, the Biokovo massif gradually recedes behind, the shift in scale one of the more memorable parts of the whole drive in either direction. Few single journeys on this coast pack in as much visual variety, open beach resort, cliffside road, river mouth, all inside a single, comfortably paced airport transfer.": "Iz Tučepa je dulja vožnja, 82 kilometra i oko 75 minuta, cijelom obalnom cestom Makarske rivijere na sjever pokraj Promajne, Marušića, Piska i Omiša do Zračne luke Split. To je pravo putovanje, a ne kratak skok, i jedna od ljepših vožnji na ovom popisu već zbog toga koliko obale usput vidite. Kako cesta ostavlja Tučepe, Biokovo se postupno udaljava iza vas, a ta promjena mjerila jedan je od najupečatljivijih dijelova vožnje u bilo kojem smjeru. Malo koja vožnja na ovoj obali spaja toliko prizora, turističko mjesto uz plažu, cestu uz litice i ušće rijeke, u jednom ugodnom transferu do aerodroma.",
"Tell us your flight time when you book and we'll schedule your pickup in Tučepi to reach Split Airport with a comfortable margin for a drive this length. It's a direct, private drive the length of the riviera, with a stop possible if arranged in advance, the Omiš gorge and zipline sit roughly midway and make a reasonable break on a journey this length. Given the length of the drive, it's worth confirming your exact hotel or apartment complex when booking, since several larger properties in Tučepi share similar names and sit at different points along a beachfront that runs for some distance. On journeys of this length, it's also worth mentioning any specific timing needs, an early start, a preference to leave with plenty of buffer, so the driver can plan the route and any stop accordingly rather than working to guesswork.": "Pri rezervaciji nam napišite vrijeme leta i preuzimanje u Tučepima dogovorit ćemo s dovoljno rezerve za ovako dugu vožnju do Zračne luke Split. Vožnja je izravna i privatna cijelom duljinom rivijere, uz mogućnost stajanja ako se dogovori unaprijed: kanjon Cetine i zip-line kod Omiša otprilike su na pola puta i dobra su pauza na ovako dugoj vožnji. Zbog duljine puta pri rezervaciji potvrdite točan hotel ili apartmansko naselje, jer nekoliko većih objekata u Tučepima ima slična imena, a nalaze se na različitim mjestima duž dugačke obale. Na ovako dugim vožnjama vrijedi navesti i posebne vremenske želje, raniji polazak ili veću rezervu, kako bi vozač prema tome isplanirao rutu i stajanja, a ne nagađao.",
"How much is a private transfer from Vinišće to the airport?": "Koliko košta privatni transfer iz Vinišća do aerodroma?",
"Vinišće is one of the shorter runs on this list: twenty kilometres and around twenty-five minutes, leaving the bay on the same road used for Trogir before joining the main route south to the airport. The road hugs the inlet for the first stretch, giving a last clear view of the anchored yachts before the village drops out of sight behind, an easy, unhurried way to start a journey home. Even at this short distance the scenery shifts noticeably, the quiet run of olive terraces and small stone jetties gives way to the busier hotel strip around Trogir as the road tracks the bay's edge. Because the whole journey takes under half an hour, it's a popular choice for visitors who'd rather spend their last hour in Croatia by the water than sitting in a car, and the fixed price means there's no temptation to rush the driver on what is already a short, easy run.": "Vinišće je jedna od kraćih vožnji na ovom popisu: dvadeset kilometara i oko dvadeset pet minuta, iz uvale cestom prema Trogiru, a zatim glavnom rutom do aerodroma. Cesta u prvom dijelu prati uvalu, pa još jednom vidite usidrene jahte prije nego što mjesto nestane iza vas, lagan i miran početak puta kući. I na ovako kratkoj udaljenosti krajolik se primjetno mijenja: mirni maslinici i mali kameni molovi ustupaju mjesto prometnijem nizu hotela oko Trogira. Budući da cijela vožnja traje manje od pola sata, omiljena je među gostima koji svoj zadnji sat u Hrvatskoj radije provode uz more nego u autu, a zbog fiksne cijene nema razloga požurivati vozača na ionako kratkoj i laganoj vožnji.",
"The driver arrives on time with your flight details already noted, so a pickup this short still runs to a proper schedule rather than a rough estimate. It's a direct transfer with no other stops: your luggage goes in at your accommodation in Vinišće and comes out at the terminal, with the driver on hand to help either end. Given the short distance, this is also a popular route for guests staying in Trogir who spent a day out at Vinišće's beach and need a lift back rather than negotiating a taxi at short notice. Couples and small groups travelling with just hand luggage often find the Sedan more than sufficient for this particular route, keeping the cost as low as possible for a genuinely short hop.": "Vozač stiže na vrijeme s već zabilježenim podacima o letu, pa i ovako kratko preuzimanje ide po pravom rasporedu, a ne po procjeni. Transfer je izravan, bez drugih stajanja: prtljaga ulazi u vozilo kod vašeg smještaja u Vinišću i izlazi na terminalu, a vozač pomaže na oba kraja. Zbog kratke udaljenosti ovu rutu često biraju i gosti iz Trogira koji su dan proveli na plaži u Vinišću i trebaju prijevoz natrag umjesto traženja taksija u zadnji čas. Parovima i manjim grupama samo s ručnom prtljagom limuzina je obično sasvim dovoljna za ovu rutu, uz najnižu moguću cijenu za stvarno kratku vožnju.",
"How much does the transfer from Živogošće to Split Airport cost?": "Koliko košta transfer iz Živogošća do Zračne luke Split?",
"Which hamlet of Živogošće will the driver collect me from?": "U kojem će me zaseoku Živogošća vozač preuzeti?",
"Give the exact hamlet, Porat, Mala Duba, Blato or Vrulja, in your booking notes, and the driver will confirm the precise pickup point.": "U napomeni rezervacije navedite točan zaselak, Porat, Malu Dubu, Blato ili Vrulju, i vozač će potvrditi točno mjesto preuzimanja.",
"Leaving Živogošće is the longest of the Makarska Riviera runs on this list: a full 100 kilometres and around 90 minutes, retracing the entire coast road north through Tučepi, Makarska and Omiš back to Split Airport. It's a genuine cross-country transfer rather than a short hop, worth booking with a driver who knows the road well enough to keep the long drive comfortable rather than just long. The first stretch out of Živogošće is the quietest part of the journey, before the road passes back through the busier resort strip around Tučepi and Makarska on the way north. For travellers with an early or late flight, the length of this transfer is exactly where flight-time coordination and a fixed price matter most: no rank taxi queue to negotiate, just a driver already briefed on your route and timing.": "Iz Živogošća je najdulja vožnja na Makarskoj rivijeri s ovog popisa: punih 100 kilometara i oko 90 minuta, cijelom obalnom cestom na sjever kroz Tučepe, Makarsku i Omiš natrag do Zračne luke Split. To je pravi dugi transfer, a ne kratak skok, i vrijedi ga rezervirati s vozačem koji dovoljno dobro poznaje cestu da duga vožnja bude ugodna, a ne samo duga. Prva dionica iz Živogošća najmirniji je dio puta, a zatim cesta prolazi kroz prometniji turistički potez oko Tučepa i Makarske. Za putnike s ranim ili kasnim letom upravo na ovako dugom transferu usklađivanje s vremenom leta i fiksna cijena znače najviše: nema reda za taksi, samo vozač koji već zna vašu rutu i raspored.",
"Given the length of this transfer, tell us your flight time as early as possible when you book. We'll schedule your pickup in Živogošće with a generous margin so a drive this long never turns into a rushed one. The drive is direct and private the whole way, with a stop possible at any point along the riviera if arranged in advance, and a proper break built into the schedule if you'd like one on a journey this length. Since Živogošće is spread across several separate hamlets rather than one town centre, confirming exactly which part, Porat, Mala Duba, Blato or Vrulja, you're staying in when you book makes a real difference to how directly the driver can reach you for pickup. Given the distance involved, most guests booking this route have settled in for at least a week, and the driver is happy to note your original arrival transfer details at the same time if you'd like to book both journeys together.": "Zbog duljine ovog transfera javite nam vrijeme leta što ranije pri rezervaciji. Preuzimanje u Živogošću dogovorit ćemo s velikom rezervom, kako ovako duga vožnja nikad ne bi postala žurba. Vožnja je izravna i privatna cijelim putem, uz mogućnost stajanja bilo gdje na rivijeri ako se dogovori unaprijed, te pravu pauzu u planu ako je na ovako dugom putu želite. Budući da je Živogošće raspoređeno na nekoliko zasebnih zaselaka, a ne oko jednog središta, točna informacija u kojem dijelu odsjedate, Portu, Maloj Dubi, Blatu ili Vrulji, puno znači za to koliko izravno vas vozač može preuzeti. Zbog udaljenosti većina gostiju na ovoj ruti ostaje barem tjedan dana, a vozač rado istodobno zabilježi i podatke za dolazni transfer ako želite rezervirati obje vožnje zajedno.",
})
